	Fire.Quake1:
		Q1E6 A 0
		Goto CoopHold
	Fire.Quake2:
		Q2E6 A 0
		Goto CoopHold
	Fire.Quake3:
		Q3E6 A 0
		Goto CoopHold
	Fire.Quake4:
